{"seq":1,"slug":"why-not-generative","title":"为什么不生成像素：LeCun 论纲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/motivation-mechanism/why-not-generative","wordCount":2244,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"为什么不生成像素-lecun-论纲\">为什么不生成像素：LeCun 论纲</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>2017 年之后，深度学习的默认叙事是「生成一切」：文本模型预测下一个 token，图像模型预测被遮住的 patch，视频模型预测未来的每一帧。这条路线把「智能」等价于「高保真重建」。Yann LeCun 在 2022 年公开发布的技术报告《A Path Towards Autonomous Machine Intelligence》中给出了一个相反的论纲：智能系统的核心能力不是重建观测，而是<strong>在抽象表征空间中预测观测的后果</strong>；像素级的生成既非必要，也常常有害。这份论纲后来凝结为 JEPA（Joint-Embedding Predictive Architecture）这一系列工作，也就是本 hub 的主角。</p>\n<p>论纲的出发点是一个朴素的问题：猫扑向移动的猎物时，并不需要预测草叶每一根的振动轨迹。世界模型真正需要预测的是「与决策相关的状态变化」，而观测信号中大量成分是环境噪声、材质细节和混沌微观运动——它们原则上不可预测，强行预测只会浪费容量并扭曲表征。下面的流程图对比了两种建模范式的基本结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[当前观测 x] --&gt; B[编码器 encoder]&#10;    B --&gt; C[表征 s_x]&#10;    C --&gt; D[预测器 predictor]&#10;    D --&gt; E[预测的未来表征 s_y]&#10;    F[未来观测 y] --&gt; G[目标编码器]&#10;    G --&gt; H[真实未来表征 s_y_bar]&#10;    E --&gt; I{在嵌入空间比较}&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    A --&gt; J[像素级解码分支&lt;br/&gt;生成式路线]&#10;    J --&gt; K[重建每个像素&lt;br/&gt;容量花在不可预测细节上]\">flowchart TD\n    A[当前观测 x] --&gt; B[编码器 encoder]\n    B --&gt; C[表征 s_x]\n    C --&gt; D[预测器 predictor]\n    D --&gt; E[预测的未来表征 s_y]\n    F[未来观测 y] --&gt; G[目标编码器]\n    G --&gt; H[真实未来表征 s_y_bar]\n    E --&gt; I{在嵌入空间比较}\n    H --&gt; I\n    A --&gt; J[像素级解码分支&lt;br/&gt;生成式路线]\n    J --&gt; K[重建每个像素&lt;br/&gt;容量花在不可预测细节上]</pre><h2 id=\"不可预测的成分-条件熵论证\">不可预测的成分：条件熵论证</h2><p>用一点信息论可以把问题说得很精确。给定历史观测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，未来观测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 的不确定性由条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(y \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 刻画。对于视频这类高维连续信号，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(y \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 中的大部分来自对决策无关的细节：水面波纹的精确形状、人群个体的微表情、风吹过树冠的相位。生成式模型以极大似然训练时，优化的正是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log p_\\theta(y \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，它必须为这些不可约简的随机性分配概率质量。结果就是著名的「模糊均值」现象——逐像素均方误差最优的预测是把所有可能未来平均后的糊状图像。</p>\n<p>LeCun 论纲的关键一步是引入一个编码函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，把观测映射到表征空间后再做预测：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_x = g(x), \\quad \\hat{s}_y = f(s_x), \\quad \\mathcal{L} = \\lVert \\hat{s}_y - h(y) \\rVert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)∥</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 学会丢弃不可预测的细节、保留语义与动力学结构，预测任务的难度就由「可预测信息量」而非「像素数量」决定。这就是「为什么不生成像素」的信息论答案：不是不能生成，而是生成的目标里混入了大量不该被建模的熵。这一机制层面的展开见 <a href=\"../motivation-mechanism/jepa-mechanism\">JEPA 机制</a>，此处只立骨架。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单步最优解为什么不可用\">单步最优解为什么不可用</h3><p>把「熵税」写成一个可以检验的断言。若损失取像素级均方误差，对固定历史 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，使损失最小的预测不是「最可能的未来」，而是条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}^*(x) = \\mathbb{E}[y \\mid x]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。当条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(y \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 较大时，这个期望值等价于把所有可能未来按其概率加权平均，得到一张缺乏高频细节的糊图。问题因此不出在模型容量，而出在损失函数把「不可约的随机性」也当成了应当拟合的信号——这正是扩散与自回归模型宁可付出多步采样的代价、也要放弃单步回归的直接原因。</p>\n<p>换到表征空间，同一份数据的处境完全不同。预测目标不是某个具体未来 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>，而是它编码后的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_y = h(y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。只要编码器把「多种可能未来共享的语义骨架」压进少数几个自由度，预测器要拟合的就只剩这部分低熵结构，而高熵细节在编码阶段被主动丢弃、根本不进入损失。两个目标函数看着都在「预测未来」，被要求解释的熵却差了一个数量级——这就是不生成像素的全部理由，也是后续所有机制设计的出发点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能量模型-排序而不是归一化\">能量模型：排序而不是归一化</h2><p>论纲的第二个支柱是把推断表述为能量最小化而非概率采样。定义一个能量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，度量「未来 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 与当前情境 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的相容程度」，模型的任务变成在候选集合中寻找 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>y</mi></msub><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^* = \\arg\\min_y E(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。与概率模型相比，能量模型不需要计算配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z(x) = \\int e^{-E(x,y)} dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1941em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>——在高维空间这个积分不可处理，也正是扩散模型和自回归模型必须付出千百步迭代采样的根源。</p>\n<p>排序视角带来一个重要的工程自由度：负样本可以只取少数几个「坏候选」，而不必覆盖整个分布。对比学习正是这么做的，但它依赖海量负样本；JEPA 系列选择另一条路——通过架构不对称性（stop-gradient 与指数滑动平均的目标编码器）避免坍缩。两条防坍缩路线的成本与适用场景差异，会在 <a href=\"../paradigm-comparison/vs-contrastive-masked\">对比学习与掩码建模路线</a> 中正面展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"能量视角解决了什么\">能量视角解决了什么</h3><p>能量表述的收益可以直接从三项操作上看出来。推断只需在候选集合上比较能量值、取最小者，不要求能量函数本身是一个归一化概率分布；学习只需拉低正确 (x, y) 对的能量、抬高被采样到的错误对，避免了对全空间积分的估计；而「能力用在比较而非拟合」这一点，天然对应到「选择而非生成」的下游用法——规划器要的本来就是排序后的候选动作，不是一个可以直接采样的完整未来分布。反过来，能量模型也有代价：它只给出相对分数，无法直接提供似然，遇到需要「这个未来有多大概率」的场景仍要额外拟合校准。这笔取舍在规划章节会再次出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"论纲中的系统分层\">论纲中的系统分层</h2><p>技术报告不止谈预训练，还给出一个自主智能体的完整模块化设计。它的意义在于说明：JEPA 不是又一个视觉预训练技巧，而是整个认知架构的地基层。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>感知模块</td>\n<td>把感官输入编码为表征</td>\n<td>JEPA 编码器的角色原型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>世界模型</td>\n<td>在潜空间预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 及其不确定度</td>\n<td>JEPA 预测器的目标形态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代价模块</td>\n<td>固有的本能代价 + 可学习的批评家</td>\n<td>规划时的打分依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行器</td>\n<td>由世界模型与代价驱动的策略</td>\n<td>潜空间规划的落点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置器</td>\n<td>根据任务设定优先级与参数</td>\n<td>跨任务泛化的调度层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中「世界模型 + 代价 + 执行器」的组合直接指向基于模型的规划：智能体在想象中滚动潜变量、用代价函数挑选行动序列，而不是在真实世界试错。这条线在 <a href=\"../evidence-applications/planning-with-latent-models\">用潜空间模型做规划</a> 里有完整的算法描述；V-JEPA 2-AC 已经把它跑在了真实机械臂上，能力证据见 <a href=\"../evidence-applications/vjepa2-capabilities\">V-JEPA 2 的能力面</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"论纲如何落到可运行的系统\">论纲如何落到可运行的系统</h2><p>从 2022 年的论纲到可验证的系统，中间隔着三步台阶。第一步是证明联合嵌入预测在图像上能学到语义表征，这是 I-JEPA 的贡献；第二步是扩展到视频并吸收时间动力学，这是 V-JEPA 与 V-JEPA 2 的贡献；第三步是接入动作条件使潜空间可用于控制，即 V-JEPA 2-AC。三代模型的设计差异、参数规模与基准成绩单，统一收录在 <a href=\"../motivation-mechanism/jepa-family-tree\">JEPA 家族：I-JEPA、V-JEPA 与 V-JEPA 2</a>，避免在多篇文档里重复罗列同一批数字。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是论纲与主流路线的分岔点位置。生成式世界模型（如 Genie 类系统）同样追求「想象未来」，但选择在解码空间完成想象，换来可渲染、可交互的画面，付出的是采样成本与细节幻觉；LLM 路线的支持者则主张序列建模本身就能涌现世界知识。这两场正面对比的完整论述分别在 <a href=\"../paradigm-comparison/vs-generative-world-models\">生成式世界模型（Genie 类）</a> 与 <a href=\"../paradigm-comparison/vs-llm-world-models\">LLM 作为世界模型的争论</a>。理解分岔点在哪，比记住谁赢更重要——因为 2026 年的证据表明两条路线正在互相借用部件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>论纲的要害可以压成三句话：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>像素生成的损失里混着不可约简的条件熵，容量被噪声吃掉；</li>\n<li>能量最小化让模型「排序候选未来」，绕开不可处理的配分函数；</li>\n<li>五模块架构中 JEPA 只负责感知与世界模型两层，其余留给规划与配置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>后续章节按「机制—家族—对比—实证—上手」的顺序逐段检验这套论纲。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为什么不生成像素：LeCun 论纲","id":"为什么不生成像素-lecun-论纲"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不可预测的成分：条件熵论证","id":"不可预测的成分-条件熵论证"},{"level":3,"text":"单步最优解为什么不可用","id":"单步最优解为什么不可用"},{"level":2,"text":"能量模型：排序而不是归一化","id":"能量模型-排序而不是归一化"},{"level":3,"text":"能量视角解决了什么","id":"能量视角解决了什么"},{"level":2,"text":"论纲中的系统分层","id":"论纲中的系统分层"},{"level":2,"text":"论纲如何落到可运行的系统","id":"论纲如何落到可运行的系统"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"JEPA 机制：联合嵌入与潜空间预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/motivation-mechanism/jepa-mechanism"}}